* WEBCONCFG SAMPLE - copy to WEBCON CFG A and edit on the guest.
* This file is parsed as KEY VALUE lines. '*' and blank lines ignored.
* Do not commit real passwords or tokens.
PORT 8080
BIND INADDR_ANY
USERID webuser
PASSHASH replace-with-sha256-hex
SESSION_TTL 1800
MAX_BODY 4096
MAX_OUT 16384
CMD_TIMEOUT 30
LOGFILE WEBCONS LOG A
UIFILE WEBCONS HTML A
AUDITFILE WEBCONS AUDIT A
ALLOW QUERY *
ALLOW INDICATE *
ALLOW LISTFILE *
ALLOW TYPE *
ALLOW FIND *
ALLOW GREP *
ALLOW NETSTAT *
DENY CP IPL *
DENY CP SYSTEM *
DENY DIRECTXA *
DENY FORMAT *
DENY LOGOFF *
DENY SHUTDOWN *
